# Bonus B: Webhooks
# Run the API and the receiver (src/Ticketing.WebhookReceiver, http://localhost:5005).
@host = https://localhost:7001
@receiver = http://localhost:5005
@dana = paste-dana-token-here
@alice = paste-alice-token-here
@subscriptionId = paste-the-id-from-the-201
@ticketId = paste-a-ticket-id

### Subscribe the receiver: 201, with the signing secret. Copy it: you won't see it again.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "{{receiver}}/webhooks", "events": ["ticket.closed"] }

### Now restart the receiver with that secret:
###   dotnet run --project src/Ticketing.WebhookReceiver -- --Webhook:Secret whsec_...

### List subscriptions: no secrets in here
GET {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Requesters can't subscribe: 403
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "{{receiver}}/webhooks", "events": ["ticket.closed"] }

### Not a URL, or an event that doesn't exist: 400
POST {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "ftp://example.com/hooks", "events": ["ticket.exploded"] }

### Create a ticket to close
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Webhook demo", "description": "Close me.", "priority": "Low", "requesterId": "carol" }

### Close it: the response comes right back; watch the receiver's console
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tickets/{{ticketId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### What the receiver got
GET {{receiver}}/

### What the API recorded
GET {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks/{{subscriptionId}}/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}

### Make the receiver fail the next 2 deliveries, then close another ticket: 2 failures, 1 success, one id
POST {{receiver}}/fail-next/2

### Make it fail more times than the API retries: the delivery is recorded as Failed
POST {{receiver}}/fail-next/10

### Unsubscribe: 204
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/webhooks/{{subscriptionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{dana}}
